    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type, grow, and decorate \u2013 let your plants thrive while you work.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every keystroke helps a little plant grow! Whether you're writing, coding, or just chatting, this peaceful desktop overlay brings a touch of green to your everyday routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a tiny sprout that grows as you type. When your screen gets crowded, move your plants to a foldable <strong>plant shelf</strong>, where they continue growing quietly in the background. Over time, you'll discover a variety of <strong>plant types!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your desktop with your favorite green companions and build your own little digital garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you're the productive type, track how much you've typed with a gentle <strong>growth-based progress system</strong> \u2013 watch your focus bloom alongside your plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plants grow with every keystroke</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move grown plants into a collapsible shelf to clear your screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a variety of plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep growing plants even when they're in storage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your desktop with your favorite green friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your typing activity through plant growth</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type, grow, and decorate \u2013 let your plants thrive while you work.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every keystroke helps a little plant grow! Whether you're writing, coding, or just chatting, this peaceful desktop overlay brings a touch of green to your everyday routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a tiny sprout that grows as you type. When your screen gets crowded, move your plants to a foldable <strong>plant shelf</strong>, where they continue growing quietly in the background. Over time, you'll discover a variety of <strong>plant types!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your desktop with your favorite green companions and build your own little digital garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you're the productive type, track how much you've typed with a gentle <strong>growth-based progress system</strong> \u2013 watch your focus bloom alongside your plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plants grow with every keystroke</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move grown plants into a collapsible shelf to clear your screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a variety of plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep growing plants even when they're in storage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your desktop with your favorite green friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your typing activity through plant growth</p></li></ul>",
